guide.minere.entity.vampire.description=A strong, fast hostile creature found underground. It regains health when attacking, takes extra damage from gold weapons, and can turn into a bat at low health.
guide.minere.entity.grizzly_bear.description=A powerful forest animal most common in taigas. It can be tamed with fish and honey, but wild bears become angry when players get too close to their babies.
